      "created_at": "2016-02-16T17:31:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"hynju\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ad7895/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> hynju:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/users/drevilz4l\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" title=\"View user profile.\">drevilz4l</a>,Thanks for posting this.I'm been wondering for a few days whether I should or not.&nbsp;These are a fun and talented group of people.&nbsp; I've worked with them on a couple of occasions.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I've met a few of them over the years at GenCon and they are all an awesome group. Very passionate about their work. I feel like I want to know what happens next in JourneyQuest and The Gamers series more than pretty much any other TV show or movie. (The ending of Hands of Fate killed me!).</p>",
